            <ArticleTitle>NRG4: an endocrine link between brown adipose tissue and liver.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.cmet.2014.12.008</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1550-4131(14)00559-2</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Brown adipose tissue (BAT) directly regulates energy homeostasis via uncoupling of mitochondrial ATP production and thermogenesis. Wang et al. (2014) now report that BAT controls liver lipogenesis via secretion of the growth factor NRG4.</AbstractText>
